#. module: pos_checkout_extras
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:pos_checkout_extras.report_pos_analytic_coverage
msgid ""
"Stamped: the journal item carries exactly the distribution set on the point of sale today.\n"
"                            Missing: no distribution, usually items created before the distribution was set; use Synchronise in the point of sale settings.\n"
"                            Other: a different distribution, for example one entered by hand or an older distribution of the counter."
msgstr ""
"Tercap: item jurnal membawa persis distribusi yang terpasang di point of sale saat ini.\n"
"                            Kosong: tanpa distribusi, biasanya item yang dibuat sebelum distribusi diisi; gunakan Sinkronkan di pengaturan point of sale.\n"
"                            Lain: distribusi berbeda, misalnya diisi manual atau distribusi lama counter ini."

